['para',2,null,null,'How does the text characterize the relation between sleep phases and memory?',['Each phase performs a completely isolated function.','Different phases may support different functions but also interact.','Dreaming is the only phase relevant to memory.','Slow-wave sleep prevents the integration of ideas.','Sleep cycles matter only for spatial memory.'],'The paragraph assigns tendencies to phases while warning they are not sealed compartments.'],
